662..737 Comment "/// A dialogue that reports once and retires, the seat\'s send of its report"
738..814 Comment "/// logged before the operator takes the choice. Its web is series-parallel:"
815..887 Comment "/// the seat\'s report beside the operator\'s choice, then the seat\'s tail"
888..920 Comment "/// beside the operator\'s close."
